<title>FRANCE: Iran bought 150-200,000 T Argentine maize-trader.</title>
<headline>Iran bought 150-200,000 T Argentine maize-trader.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran bought between 150,000 and 200,000 tonnes of Argentine maize at around $118 per tonne, Fob, last weekend and further purchases cannot be ruled out, European grain traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>One exporter said Iran planned to tender on April 21 to buy 120,000 tonnes of optional-origin maize.</p>
<p>But other exporters said a new tender was not very likely right after the Argentine deal although further purchases could not be ruled out.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
